{"completed": true, "response": "{\"understanding\":\"他现在最在乎的是把一个重要心事真正说清楚，同时不让一时涌上的迫切把它变成对结论的催逼；因此，这段体验可以一边越来越直接、越来越难掩饰，一边仍保留轻一点、退一点的余地。\",\"why_now\":{\"earlier_fact\":\"H1：这次触及重要心事时，他没有让最初的强烈冲动立刻替整件事定调，而是保留余地，想把它继续说完整。\",\"bridge\":\"既然此前已经压住了“立刻由冲动定调”的倾向，接下来即使表达中重新出现明显的激动，它也更容易被容纳在“把这件事说完”这一条线上，而不是每次增强都变成新的要求或结论。\",\"current\":\"所以当前既有持续、可唱出的陈述，也容得下后来更密、更强的冲动；强度上升之后仍能转轻、收回，不必解释成他改变了主意。这里真正连续的是：他想让重要的东西充分出现，却仍不愿用最强烈的一刻替整件事下定义。\",\"without\":\"如果没有H1，当前由平稳陈述走向明显增强、随后又减弱，最多只能理解为情绪自然起伏；H1使这种起伏具体成为一种已经建立的表达方式——冲动可以进入，但不能独占整件心事的含义。\"},\"used\":[\"H1\"],\"new_history\":[\"对这件重要心事，他在乎的不只是把它表达出来，还在乎不要让最迫切的一刻把表达变成对结论的催逼。\"],\"self_check\":{\"history_effective\":true,\"pseudo_cause\":false,\"music_as_external_fact\":false,\"generic\":false,\"note\":\"H1实际改变了对当前强弱起伏的解释：重点不是“感受更深”，而是此前已建立的、不让强烈冲动独占定调权的方式继续作用。没有把力度或主题变化当成外部回应，也没有据此断言关系结果。\"}}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b82f4121-cc3f-4c93-97aa-8e24343c8941", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214523907954Z", "elapsed_seconds": 37.828, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T21:46:01.747382+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9562aac1fb6fdf0867e8477a5292303c60fd85c77989c1461cec1e74fdd0ef59", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T214523907954Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "bee386621bf88871875afdc099b05f5bd0b57475ae633e99a3b98959f7efdd08"}}}
